        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>学校管理思维导图</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", SimSun, sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #000;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .text-blue {\n    color: #000080;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .section {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .vertical-text {\n    width: 2em;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #000080;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 1.1em;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .vertical-text span {\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .v-gap {\n    height: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .brace-container {\n    width: 20px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    margin: 0 5px;\n  }\n  .brace {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: visible;\n  }\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .topic {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .topic:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .topic-title {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #000080;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    width: 3em;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .topic-details {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n  }\n  .detail-row {\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .detail-row:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .detail-row.has-sub {\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .sub-label {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    padding-right: 2px;\n  }\n  .sub-details {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n  }\n  .sub-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .sub-row:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .final-paragraph {\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    margin-left: calc(3em + 30px);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"vertical-text\">\n    <span>第</span><span>九</span><span>章</span>\n    <div class=\"v-gap\"></div>\n    <span>学</span><span>校</span><span>财</span><span>产</span><span>与</span><span>财</span><span>务</span><span>管</span><span>理</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"brace-container\">\n    <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"topic\">\n      <div class=\"topic-title\">财产<br>管理</div>\n      <div class=\"brace-container\">\n        <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topic-details\">\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">含义：</span>\n          <span>对学校物质财富的计划组织、使用保管活动。<br>包括固定资产和流动资产。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">内容：</span>\n          <span>目标；制度；账务；添置；维修。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">原则：</span>\n          <span>物尽其用；建章立制；帐物相符；管理育人。</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"topic\">\n      <div class=\"topic-title\">财务<br>管理</div>\n      <div class=\"brace-container\">\n        <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topic-details\">\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">含义：</span>\n          <span>指学校资金运转中的计划组织和控制。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row has-sub\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">内容</span>\n          <div class=\"brace-container\">\n            <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sub-details\">\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">预算管理：</span>\n              <span>按一定程序和方法核定的年度收支预计；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">收入管理：</span>\n              <span>对学校收入的计划组织和控制，包括财政收入、经营收入、学杂费等收入；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">支出管理：</span>\n              <span>经费支出的计划组织和控制；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">资金管理：</span>\n              <span>现金、银行存款、往来管理；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">财务报表：</span>\n              <span>收支、因素、结果分析；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">财务制度和财务监督：</span>\n              <span>财务人员要求：持证上岗、坚持原则、作风正派、履行职责；财务监督通过财务审计执行。</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"vertical-text\">\n    <span>第</span><span>十</span><span>章</span>\n    <div class=\"v-gap\"></div>\n    <span>学</span><span>校</span><span>德</span><span>育</span><span>管</span><span>理</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"brace-container\">\n    <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"topic\">\n      <div class=\"topic-title\">地位<br>与<br>特点</div>\n      <div class=\"brace-container\">\n        <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topic-details\">\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">含义：</span>\n          <span>德育即思想品德教育（育德），包括政治教育、思想教育、品德教育、法纪教育、心理教育。德育管理：即德育管理者运用方法手段，...资源，......目标。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">地位</span>\n          <span>（学校管理与德育的关系）：学校管理包含德育管理；相互影响；相互渗透；相互促进。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">特点：</span>\n          <span>方向性；教育性；伦理性；全员性。</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"topic\">\n      <div class=\"topic-title\">要素<br>与<br>层次</div>\n      <div class=\"brace-container\">\n        <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topic-details\">\n        <div class=\"detail-row has-sub\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">要素</span>\n          <div class=\"brace-container\">\n            <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sub-details\">\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">德育管理目标：</span>\n              <span>具有定向、调节、评价作用；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">德育管理主体：</span>\n              <span>组织机构；管理者；自我管理；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">德育管理客体：</span>\n              <span>人、财、物、课程、时空等资源；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">德育管理制度：</span>\n              <span>中央到地方文件，学校与班级的规章；</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">层次：</span>\n          <span>学校上层是核心定方向；学校中层是枢纽抓落实；学校基层及班级是基本单位执行者。</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"topic\">\n      <div class=\"topic-title\">机制<br>与<br>实施</div>\n      <div class=\"brace-container\">\n        <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topic-details\">\n        <div class=\"detail-row\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">机制：</span>\n          <span>德育要素进行相互作用、耦合、联系的运作方式。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"detail-row has-sub\">\n          <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">实施</span>\n          <div class=\"brace-container\">\n            <svg class=\"brace\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 100\"><path d=\"M 15 0 Q 5 0 5 10 L 5 40 Q 5 50 0 50 Q 5 50 5 60 L 5 90 Q 5 100 15 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sub-details\">\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">导向机制：</span>\n              <span>目标、舆论、行为、评价等导向；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">动力机制：</span>\n              <span>奖惩、竞争、意义或价值等激励；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">协调机制：</span>\n              <span>制度、文化协调；</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-row\">\n              <span class=\"text-blue sub-label\">约束机制：</span>\n              <span>法规、道德约束。</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"final-paragraph\">\n      <span class=\"text-blue\">提高德育德育管理者能力的途径：</span>（1）提升管理水平（理念、方法、道德）；（2）提高教育素养（教育观、教育理论）；（3）加强道德修养（把握方向、管理公正、以身作则、作风民主）\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
